.png", "id": "2392553264515420", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_2392553267848753_4145866477164997808_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mWMGnhgB9ccQ7kNvwG-xNsP&_nc_oc=Adpmv6BLfXPjdZV0aj77TCXrJmUPwFwuI8t7xcI4wLGN2dw5SCex3xPP-NnYhIUOTVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9hgR7RcPMYtazX4n5eJB4O6md_ZXMuCstOFqogqBNTw&oe=6B03128E"}, {"file_name": "27.png", "id": "849060007791741", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_849060011125074_4069190445085777822_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N1pOG8IC0rkQ7kNvwE7yZbR&_nc_oc=AdoUajsNMCBFAZOLDqvs-ljYj-ZbndjiP6p7vk57ib_X-ytAImDFMkdQ2RuYAHc5Hew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhcE5ccDsafKfxggUcPvYf3IBHy3afFU9DL03kHw92jw&oe=6B0335AC"}, {"file_name": "32.png", "id": "841714191676625", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_841714195009958_216825495650438070_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=775D8Sc55KIQ7kNvwEHU4RW&_nc_oc=Adobg6kLmG5RZS--sc1QDk773pzqius-It70PDTuaJuM2xzB_H_YN98InXEOPXijI9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSy5O0Rms5PJtienEM_05Jx6GrtdomwNkDkc5QH23lusw&oe=6B031F6C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape (2).png", "id": "1487203116629993", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1487203119963326_937934348911748853_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=41OCg5ZBJtIQ7kNvwGarrKV&_nc_oc=AdpJsSHczinwkPtwKhlM-VHhYmjNVoAI8wkCLt6rEk9wWRS9ArPtDwjZcHKzkKQaNZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLQLPfk7aZFCWpGQlMp1vz79xqZoH-w7blsG-PrXHyAQ&oe=6B032409"}, "display_name": "EGG VR T\u0130TAN", "keywords": ["scary", "baboon", "dino", "hero", "fun"], "long_description": "**Run, climb, and jump in VR using a unique Baboon Movement inspired by Gorilla Tag.**\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Hatch Egg**\n\n\n#  Steal a Brainrot\n\n**Steal Dino Brainrots and raise them and get rich**\n\n{2842365595962805}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udc7b Horror Mode\n\n**Run away from the Baboon Monster,  and fight against the boss**\n\n{851464257334354}\n\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Smash Mode\n\n**Tag Everyone and swing like a Gorilla or Baboon**\n\n{1317578033136114}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Giant Mode\n{1554376978890768}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b Shooter Mode\n\n**Play the best Rivals Shooter game**\n\n{25044154225189929}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b NEW BOMBS and Mini Games\n\n**Get eggs and hatch them. Name and ride your chicken, snail, or your dino.**\n\n{4134103796903773}\n\n{1852341419024466}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n\nAnd try to survive in the new Forest in 99 nights, Egg VR 99 Nights Survive from Deer is Coming.\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Monkey Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Egg Smash**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf1f Become an Egg!\n\n", "short_description": "Become an Egg VR Halloween, play all the popular Minigames."}]}, "developer_name": "FutureOfVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://futureofvr.games/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futur